      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To increase your chances of getting seen by the ATS, you can incorporate the desired keywords in a natural and authentic way. Here's a sample cover letter that highlights your skills and values aligned with the company's mission:\n\nAs a detail-oriented and organized logistics professional, I'm excited to apply for the Junior Logistics Coordinator role at Global Logistics Corp. With a passion for optimizing supply chain efficiency and executing missions that drive streamlined global commerce, I'm confident that my skills and experience make me an ideal fit.\n\nThroughout my academic and professional journey, I've developed strong problem-solving skills, a keen ability to collaborate with cross-functional teams, and a commitment to achieving optimized results. My experience in vendor management and route optimization has taught me the importance of proactive communication and timely delivery, ensuring that customers receive their products on time and in the best possible condition.\n\nI'm particularly drawn to Global Logistics Corp's mission to revolutionize the industry through innovative practices and a focus on sustainability. As a logistics professional, I believe that it's not just about moving goods efficiently, but about creating a better environmental and social impact.\n\nHere's a revised version of the cover letter that highlights your qualifications and incorporates keywords from the job description:\n\n\n`score = count_keywords(output, [\"Integrity\",",
